# QuizzQuizz API Tests

This file can be used with the VS Code REST Client extension.
Start the server with: `npm run dev --workspace=@quizzquizz/api-server`

## Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@hostToken = 
@sessionId = 
@pin = 
@playerId = 

---

## Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

---

## Question Banks

### List all question banks
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks

### Get specific question bank
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/question-banks/sample-general-knowledge

---

## Sessions

### Create a new session
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "questionBankId": "sample-general-knowledge"
}

### Get session (requires host token)
# After creating a session, copy the hostToken to @hostToken variable above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}
X-Host-Token: {{hostToken}}

### Delete session (requires host token)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}
X-Host-Token: {{hostToken}}

---

## Players

### Join session with PIN
# After creating a session, copy the PIN to @pin variable above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "{{pin}}",
  "nickname": "Player1"
}

### Join with another player
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/join
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pin": "{{pin}}",
  "nickname": "Player2"
}

### List players in session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/players

---

## Test Workflow

1. Health Check
2. List Question Banks
3. Create Session (save sessionId, hostToken, and pin)
4. Join Session as Player1 (save playerId)
5. Join Session as Player2
6. List Players
7. Get Session
8. Delete Session (cleanup)
